</h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-178_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">New for 2022, ECHO is bringing an all-new technology to their X Series lineup with the ECHO eFORCE™ 56V Battery System. This system features 10 tools &amp; 16 PAS attachments all running on one 56V battery platform, making it easier and more efficient than ever to get your job done right every single time. Battery-powered equipment is taking over the landscaping industry, so if you're ready to ditch the fuel, fumes, and fuss for the future, do it with a brand you already know and trust. With ECHO’s full lineup of battery and gas-powered best-in-class solutions, industry pros have more options than ever to tackle any task at hand.</p><a href="/collections/echo?filter.p.m.power.source=Battery" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-dGHlFg faKnnT pf-180_ pf-button-2">Shop ECHO Battery-Powered Equipment</a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gtJxSR cOjBdh pf-182_"><div data-pf-type="Slideshow" class="sc-czkhzk gbwwIe pf-183_"><div data-id="slider-141667d9-937e-4844-ba79-a1dbe87e8d85-all" class="pf-slider scrollfix" style="--ss-xs:1;--ss-sm:1;--ss-md:1;--ss-lg:1"><div class="pf-slide"><div class="sc-iLWWqf jOKOLw pf-184_" data-pf-type="SlideshowSlide"><div class="sc-ktJcvw lknomy pf-185_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gtJxSR cOjBdh pf-186_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-fmzxHC fjwUHy pf-187_ pf-image-1"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Echo-eForce-battery-chainsaw_1200x.jpg?v=1686513280" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Echo-eForce-battery-chainsaw.jpg?v=1686513280 1536w" width="570" height="340" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loadin